    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The Perfekt with sein",
     "texto": [
      "An important group of verbs forms the Perfekt with the present of **sein** instead of «haben».",
      "It's used with: 1) verbs of **movement or change of place** (gehen, fahren, kommen, laufen, fliegen); 2) verbs of **change of state** (aufstehen, einschlafen); 3) the verbs **bleiben** (to stay) and **sein** (to be).",
      "Just as with haben, the conjugated form of «sein» takes second position and the **participle** goes at the **end** of the sentence: **Wir sind nach Berlin gefahren.**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
